  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme level monitoring &amp; evaluation of Education Technical Assistance to General Quality Improvement Program for Equity in Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Montrose provides M&amp;E Support to TARGET. This includes advice, support and quality assurance to enrich TARGET&apos;s own M&amp;E activities and support to TARGET to make decisions based on systematically collected data. Montrose will provide independent verification of TARGET&apos;s activities and milestones. Montrose will also provide lessons learned on what works in terms of TA in Ethiopia and education TA in general.</narrative>
  </description>
